# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# Biome's formatter requires LF, and dist/ is compared byte for byte by `pnpm check:dist`. Without this file a
# contributor with `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git for Windows default) gets CRLF copies and both checks fail.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
